            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of gitpass has a native core that does not match the app. The vault was not opened and nothing was changed. Install a complete, matching build of the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build of gitpass has a native core that does not match the app. The vault was not opened and nothing was changed. Install a complete, matching build of the app."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ဤ gitpass build ၏ native core သည် app နှင့် မကိုက်ညီပါ။ Vault ကို မဖွင့်ခဲ့ဘဲ ဘာမျှ မပြောင်းလဲခဲ့ပါ။ ကိုက်ညီသော app build အပြည့်အစုံကို ထည့်သွင်းပါ။"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gitpass รุ่นนี้มี native core ที่ไม่ตรงกับแอป ไม่ได้เปิดคลังข้อมูลและไม่มีการเปลี่ยนแปลงใด ๆ โปรดติดตั้งแอปรุ่นที่สมบูรณ์และตรงกัน"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A vault is already on this device; first pull never replaces it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A vault is already on this device; first pull never replaces it."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ဤစက်တွင် vault ရှိပြီးသားဖြစ်သည်။ ပထမဆုံး pull သည် ၎င်းကို အစားမထိုးပါ။"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "มีห้องนิรภัยอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้แล้ว การดึงครั้งแรกจะไม่แทนที่ห้องนิรภัยเดิม"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Branch": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branch"
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branch"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conflicts in the last sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conflicts in the last sync"
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "နောက်ဆုံး sync တွင် ပဋိပက္ခများ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ความขัดแย้งในการซิงก์ครั้งล่าสุด"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a fine-grained personal access token on GitHub limited to only your vault repository with Contents: Read and write. It is stored in the Keychain on this device only and is never shown again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a fine-grained personal access token on GitHub limited to only your vault repository with Contents: Read and write. It is stored in the Keychain on this device only and is never shown again."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub တွင် သင့် vault repository တစ်ခုတည်းအတွက် Contents: Read and write ပါသော fine-grained personal access token ကို ဖန်တီးပါ။ ၎င်းကို ဤစက်၏ Keychain တွင်သာ သိမ်းဆည်းပြီး ထပ်မပြပါ။"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "สร้าง fine-grained personal access token บน GitHub ที่จำกัดเฉพาะ repository ของห้องนิรภัย โดยให้สิทธิ์ Contents: Read and write โทเค็นจะถูกเก็บใน Keychain ของอุปกรณ์นี้เท่านั้นและจะไม่แสดงอีก"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads the vault from the repository above, checks it with your master password and Secret Key, and only then saves it on this device. Nothing is pushed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads the vault from the repository above, checks it with your master password and Secret Key, and only then saves it on this device. Nothing is pushed."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "အထက်ပါ repository မှ vault ကို ဒေါင်းလုဒ်လုပ်ပြီး master password နှင့် Secret Key ဖြင့် စစ်ဆေးပြီးမှသာ ဤစက်တွင် သိမ်းဆည်းသည်။ ဘာမှ push မလုပ်ပါ။"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ดาวน์โหลดห้องนิรภัยจาก repository ด้านบน ตรวจสอบด้วยรหัสผ่านหลักและ Secret Key แล้วจึงบันทึกลงในอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีการ push ใด ๆ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each conflict was resolved without losing data (the local value was kept); review these items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each conflict was resolved without losing data (the local value was kept); review these items."
          }
